--- /dev/null
+++ b/releasenotes/notes/delay-since-first-attempt-1f42171687611a48.yaml
@@ -0,0 +1,6 @@
+---
+fixes:
+  - |
+    ``statistics`` now includes the ``delay_since_first_attempt`` key from the start of
+    each run, with a value of ``0`` until the first delay. Previously the key was missing
+    until after the first retry, so reading it during the first attempt raised ``KeyError``.
